Require accounts and add full auth, profile and security suite

- Gate tools (/send, /stats, /account, /admin) behind login via proxy and
  server guard; redirect to /login?next= when unauthenticated
- Copy updated from no-signup to one-time free sign-up across the site
- AuthHub: email+password sign in/up, email one-time-code (OTP), Google,
  forgot-password, and profile photo upload during signup
- Password reset flow (/reset-password) via recovery link
- Account page rebuilt with 27+ editable profile fields (grouped) and an
  avatar manager (upload / change / remove)
- Security panel: change password, backup recovery email, TOTP 2FA, delete
- Service-role admin client + /api/account/delete

